Bennie Salazar
Born: 1962
Groups: Flaming Dildos, Crandale Country Club, Bennie's Family
Chapter: The Gold Cure
Mentioned 451 times

Bennie is a producer and the founder of Sow's Ear record label, known for discovering The Conduits and the Scotty Hausmann Footprints concert. He grows up in San Francisco, resenting his hispanic heritage, and joining the punk rock scene along with his friends and bandmates from "The Flaming Dildos". Through this scene he meets Lou, a successful producer, and becomes his protégé. Bennie lives in Crandale, NY with his son Chris and his wife Stephanie until their divorce in 2005 (he cheats on her), where he is thrown out on his own. While in Crandale, Bennie struggles to adapt to his new environment, surrounded by wealthy country club members who berate him with racially charged remarks. Sasha worked as his assistant for some 12 years, witnessing his divorce and declining mental state as a result. She notes that Bennie is eccentric, who sprinkles gold flakes into his coffee and uses pesticide as deodorant. Bennie can be said to have inherited some odd traits from his former mentor Lou.

